  "change_summary": "Pharmacist review draft: preserve the legacy weight conversion, preset selection, single-dose caps, frequency, and daily-total calculation. No preset is approved for clinical use. Assign every field to its declared form section. Supersedes engineering review.1; remains unapproved. Complete HTML field and option coverage; preserve radio and multiline controls. Supersedes engineering review.2.",
  "definition": {
    "schema_version": "1.0",
    "tool_type": "calculator",
    "title": "Legacy Medication Dose Calculation (Unapproved)",
    "description": "Reproduces the legacy educational dose arithmetic for pharmacist review. It must not be published or used to prescribe or administer medication before approval.",
